    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Muranishi and Toshi arrive at a small Sapporo photo studio run by producer Kawada. Kawada warns Muranishi how dangerous the business can be, then suddenly challenges him to direct the set himself. Just follow the flow of the visit first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何だよ、ここ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お電話した村西です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "大丈夫かよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ちょっと待ってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "手を出した知り合いは、今刑務所にいますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "余計なものはないほうがいい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あなたならどう撮りますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "トシ、ちょっと椅子をどかそうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "その椅子、オレンジの椅子をね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
