    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "大丈夫かよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this place really okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ちょっと待ってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please wait a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "手を出した知り合いは、今刑務所にいますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'An acquaintance who dabbled in that is in prison right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "余計なものはないほうがいい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is better not to have unnecessary things.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あなたならどう撮りますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If it were you, how would you shoot it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
